[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3684728428","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114252#issuecomment-3684728428","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114252","id":3684728428,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7boH5s","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-23T01:30:20Z","updated_at":"2025-12-23T01:49:18Z","body":"It might be worth to combine the two while we have the chance in beta, make it `EditorDock::open(bool make_visible = true)` Just because of the similarity and how behind the scenes they are now calling the same function.\r\n\r\nAs far as I can tell there is only a single reference to `EditorDock::open` in source (which is in the BottomPanel for compatibility), which lends to combining the two if `open` by itself is a niche case. This contradicts how the `open` name would make new users think that it is preferred over `make_visible` because it's name more directly addresses the need to open the dock.\r\n\r\nAs to the use-case of focusing a dock tab, there currently is several cases when for example the game is run and focus is sent to the debugger or output docks, which makes sense as now the user wants to interact with those areas. Essentially focus currently is grabbed when the user presses a button to open the dock (rather than it happen contextually)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3684728428/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3703864883","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114252#issuecomment-3703864883","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114252","id":3703864883,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cxH4z","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-01T16:16:53Z","updated_at":"2026-01-01T16:16:53Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/god